      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    stocks = 500000\n    fixed_income = 330000\n    house_value = 350000\n    present_value_earnings = 980000\n\n    mortgage = 175000\n    future_consumption = 870000\n    college_tuition = 150000\n    family_foundation = 600000\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_economic_assets = (\n        stocks\n        + fixed_income\n        + house_value\n        + present_value_earnings\n    )\n\n    total_economic_liabilities = (\n        mortgage\n        + future_consumption\n        + college_tuition\n        + family_foundation\n    )\n\n    economic_net_worth = total_economic_assets - total_economic_liabilities\n\n    # Return the answer to a single decimal place\n    return round(economic_net_worth, 1)\n```",
